OL,3,GNEWSASupport offered to people who
OL,4,Areport child abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign aims to offer more support
OL,7,Fto people who report child sexual
OL,8,Fabuse.
OL,10,FNSPCC Jersey led a project to bring the
OL,11,FUK-based Lucy Faithfull Foundation's
OL,12,FStop It Now campaign to the island with
OL,13,Fsupport from the government and police.
OL,15,FAnyone concerned about the safety of
OL,16,Fchildren could report it to the
OL,17,Fanonymous Stop It Now helpline while
OL,18,Fsupport was available via the website,
OL,19,Fsaid NSPCC Jersey.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
