OL,3,GNEWSASupport offered to people who
OL,4,Areport child abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatherine McGovern, the charity's
OL,7,Fpartnership service manager, said: "We
OL,8,Fwant islanders to know that the support
OL,9,Fis there and it is available to them.
OL,10,FIt's confidential and it's a way to
OL,11,Fprevent sexual abuse of children."
